# The example PDFs under test/ are committed on purpose: they are the browsable
# style gallery, so the packages can be reviewed without a TeX installation.
# The compatibility guard's PDF is a build product only -- it is compared
# against its own previous render, never read.  Unanchored, so it is ignored
# wherever it is built.
test-compat.pdf
